{"id":16426359665,"name":"PARANORMAL [HORROR]","desc":"NEW CONTENT UPDATE 1.5 IS OUT!!! Use Code \"1POINT5\" for a Free Genesis Gun Box!\n\n⚠️ WARNING: INTENSE HORROR\nThis experience contains flashing lights, loud sounds, and terrifying jumpscares. Not recommended for players with photosensitive epilepsy or heart conditions.\n\nExperience the Horror:\n\n● Unique Encounters: Explore haunted rooms, uncover cursed objects, and face terrifying events - no two nights are the same.\n● Solo or Co-op Play: Play alone for full immersion, or survive with up to 6 friends if you dare.\n● Multiple Endings: Your decisions determine who survives and what secrets are revealed.\n● Found Footage Style: First-person perspective with realistic camera effects for a truly immersive horror experience.\n\nCan you survive the night and save Elenoire before it’s too late?\n\n🔨 Developed by: ValentinoFella\n\nTags: Horror, Scary, Adventure, Puzzle, Story\n","path":"/game/16426359665-paranormal","slug":"16426359665-paranormal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8f384c741348f28e4f3d9bc53ed95a4c4cacf2bce0b38a16baeebee97c6ed326.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bc3932457ed28af169579ee56861298b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":181,"visitor":36603561,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-14T05:09:42.408Z","creator":{"name":"MetroPunk Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a05591662d19136a9586dea","title":"Esp","game":{"_id":"699fdb005cb5d29f784dfcf2","gameId":16426359665,"name":"PARANORMAL [HORROR]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8f384c741348f28e4f3d9bc53ed95a4c4cacf2bce0b38a16baeebee97c6ed326.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bc3932457ed28af169579ee56861298b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"16426359665-paranormal","path":"/game/16426359665-paranormal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8f384c741348f28e4f3d9bc53ed95a4